ext":"秋雨池塘透晚凉，蜻蜓飞处白蘋香。\n江南风景堪图画，怪得先生一□长。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48395,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 竹菊图","author":"赵慎","text":"赋得閒情思独工，想携卮酒对芳丛。\n铅华不为春争艳，留得先生醉颊红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48396,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 芙蓉泉石图","author":"赵慎","text":"托根不与鞠为双，历尽霜风未肯降。\n本自无心那有怨，年年清艳照秋江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48397,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 雪里山茶图","author":"赵慎","text":"一枝残雪照山城，春意原非复后生。\n羞把红颜媚儿女，梅兄知我岁寒情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48398,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 雪松图","author":"赵慎","text":"梦中衣褐定何祥，明视由来世泽长。\n谁拟前身是韩子，为他毛颖著文章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48399,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 雪景水仙图","author":"赵慎","text":"黄冠翠帔玉为姿，何处春风一见之。\n未到湘江清绝地，试看山谷老人诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":48400,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题刁光胤画册 葵石图","author":"赵慎","text":"中央正色殊堪重，况复丹心向太阳。\n可信化工